Compiling GRUB2 Bootloader inside /sources

1. Navigate to the sources directory and download GRUB2:

`cd /sources`
`curl -O https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/grub/grub-2.12.tar.xz`

2. Extract the archive and enter the build directory:

`tar -xf grub-2.12.tar.xz`
`cd grub-2.12`

3. Configure GRUB for BIOS/MBR and x86_64 systems:

`./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --disable-werror`

4. Compile and install GRUB binaries and modules:

`make -j$(nproc)`
`make install`

5. Clean up the build workspace:

`cd /sources`
`rm -rf grub-2.12*`
